  <keyword>nelson.indexing.IndexingOperationType</keyword>
  <short_description>Kind of a single indexing operation.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>t = nelson.indexing.IndexingOperationType.Paren</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <param_input>
    <param_input_item><param_name>t</param_name><param_description>an indexing operation type enumeration value.</param_description></param_input_item>
  </param_input>
  <param_output>
    <param_output_item><param_name>t</param_name><param_description>an indexing operation type enumeration value.</param_description></param_output_item>
  </param_output>
  <description>
    <p><b>nelson.indexing.IndexingOperationType</b> is an enumeration naming the kind of an
    indexing operation. Members: <b>Paren</b>, <b>Brace</b>, <b>Dot</b>, <b>ParenDelete</b>,
    <b>BraceDelete</b>. It is the <b>Type</b> property of a
    <b>nelson.indexing.IndexingOperation</b>.</p>
  </description>
